74-The two managers agree closely enough that one protocol contract is feasible. However, compilation must not simply be inserted into each existing per-node materialization loop. Doing so would amplify existing partial-install and cache-trust weaknesses. Transaction staging, cache validation, and consumer ordering are prerequisites of the implementation design.
