423-
424-Invoke the resolved Go binary directly with argument vectors—never a joined command string. With a manager-owned empty directory as CWD and the bootstrap form of the clean environment (private user/config/temp roots, `GOENV=off`, `GOTOOLCHAIN=local`, and no inherited `GOROOT` or target), run exactly once per operation:
